Trq-IvGOAznR1tkft8t6_LVX5Hg&oe=6A37FA27\"\r\n      ],\r\n      content: `The Vaccine doesn\\'t cause autism end of the story`\r\n    },\r\n\r\n\t{\r\n      title: \"\",\r\n      date: \"2020-12-24\",\r\n      photos: [\r\n        \"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/bw3123/our-treasure@main/videos/indea.mp4\"\r\n      ],\r\n      content: `Catalyst explained:-\r\n● Catalysis:\r\nis the process of increasing the rate of a chemical reaction by adding a substance known as a catalyst`\r\n    },\r\n\r\n\t{\r\n      title: \"\",\r\n      date: \"2020-12-19\",\r\n      photos: [\r\n        \"https://scontent.ftlv20-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t1.6435-9/131902151_143593777558522_2516504572348289710_n.jpg?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=833d8c&_nc_ohc=ziSVRC2BUfYQ7kNvwFnlCIu&_nc_oc=AdqPBLHuGcUaTtbuAOIy7p2HjsFRlHxZdxq8zi7QvY9auEtHX02OixGK4vOwMK4OSAQ7UoiCZ4eChK7cM3GOPbEn&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.ftlv20-2.fna&_nc_gid=CCCZmtqanOyqbF_-FNZmVA&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af4Aqw14Xgul1FYPwV-A7gPQkq06s3Sbo0U0yOWnexFJXg&oe=6A381875\"\r\n      ],\r\n      content: `● DNA or Deoxyribonucleic acid:\r\nIs a molecule composed of two polynucleotide chains that coil around each other carrying genetic instructions for the development, functioning, growth and reproduction of all known organisms and many viruses.\r\n● RNA or Ribonucleic acid:\r\nIs a polynucleotide molecule essential in various biological roles in coding, decoding, regulation and expression of genes, RNA is found in nature as a single strand folded onto itself unlike the DNA.\r\n● Proteins:\r\n Are large biomolecules, consisting of one or more long chains of amino acids.`\r\n    },\r\n\r\n\t{\r\n      title: \"\",\r\n      date: \"2020-12-13\",\r\n      photos: [\r\n        \"https://scontent.ftlv20-2.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t1.6435-9/131030162_140736577844242_8305601800242369727_n.jpg?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=833d8c&_nc_ohc=oDk7W1PJmIcQ7kNvwGQ_jXi&_nc_oc=AdqAKWrb-C87MRbLrVWgXEYU3J1hIX3_AWShUMXThtTZKcTjSKbjFHR_t13iRxJhObvGAYXDmxYbqAXbbluhN25a&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.ftlv20-2.fna&_nc_gid=VVi4u5hV58ptSM9wIXE9wQ&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af7147v2dZzezOoOKMzLzPDXzb8QJqmRIQwgyeMFU3QVmQ&oe=6A37EEEF\"\r\n      ],\r\n      content: `My brain is about to explode because of all the stupid conspiracy theories that I\\'m hearing`\r\n    },\r\n\r\n\t{\r\n      title: \"\",\r\n      date: \"2020-12-10\",\r\n      photos: [\r\n        \"https://scontent.ftlv20-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t1.6435-9/130692713_139372937980606_5893018039181946124_n.jpg?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=833d8c&_nc_ohc=i-jfShi6BB0Q7kNvwFfc3OO&_nc_oc=AdpiPRfBskg8nSQBrwqSaIZJgPgtz4uZn7yWiGbC3AXuxaJXVurq_Ff32CvZPufOuFlUe59nGPB22dLZ9JLT-c2m&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.ftlv20-1.fna&_nc_gid=NesCTsFbc1cS6AVgdJULTg&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af73_76WyG0HVx3qw_zdlzU-JkRwyV8eJrSfsyakuKH3Bw&oe=6A38158F\"\r\n      ],\r\n      content: `Stages of Decomposition:\r\nSome ppl might find it disgusting but I think it\\'s fascinating\r\nAll the elements in this universe go through cycles filled with chemical reactions:\r\nSynthesis, Decomposition, Photochemical reactions and many more\r\nAnd we\\'re not that special we\\'re just a part of many cycles`\r\n    },\r\n\r\n\t{\r\n      title: \"\",\r\n      date: \"2020-11-27\",\r\n      photos: [\r\n        \"https://scontent.ftlv20-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t1.6435-9/128469979_125022736082293_1600133492231396614_n.jpg?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=833d8c&_nc_ohc=5J2EmCBuqCIQ7kNvwE9Mr03&_nc_oc=AdqGEjCH6PvD3-LqGjA0xnfwXCKwKNBcgtRT-CGx0g5evMHNiiPEkWjdLpVM-UHB3y6I038VvWo0f8NSOuCPdJFu&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.ftlv20-1.fna&_nc_gid=AIAANs9dZWGjmkGsvns8pQ&_nc_ss=7b2a8&oh=00_Af5LodKSh4ULQQvwkrNBsQ13rqnfWvpevsjgW7ILKqQ6PQ&oe=6A38134D\",\r\n\t\t\"https://scontent.ftlv20-3.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t1.6435-9/128278929_125022759415624_6901646292678305043_n.jpg?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=833d8c&_nc_ohc=mVus1iMwJDIQ7kNvwH5FYs2&_nc_oc=Adqn7P-DyV-0i4AHpkPnIX_OdeLRwNkD9G6Wo2DU3tutlC4R_JRPLe_VOrG1L0fpKrGcCCgxHEaGGBvDwG6rnzgR&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=scontent.ftlv20-3.fna&_nc_gid=uQQEXkvzSa3wQTtsoxKqFw&_nc